      "text": "The repository requires Python 3.10 or later and uses the standard Python packaging toolchain. The test suite in tests/ validates the tokenizer, macro expander, box and page builder, font subsystem, and each output writer, including an end-to-end suite that compiles fixture documents through the public TeXJob API and compares results against committed MiKTeX-generated DVI baselines semantically. Contributors must install the development extras and run the test suite, then run ruff check . to enforce linting rules. The package registers a null handler on the aspose_tex logger to prevent unexpected logging warnings in integrated applications.",
